{"id":"n15874-1-8","stage":2,"title":"건너 · 对面","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15874-1-8-1","ko":"여기 가까운 우체국이 어디 있나요?","zh":"这里最近的邮局在哪儿呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여기","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가까운","meaning":"近","explanation":"가깝다：近；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"가깝다","audio":"/audio/9ff63e71387c2c60a305.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65200","senseId":"1","lemma":"가깝다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"우체국이","meaning":"邮局","explanation":"우체국：邮局；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"우체국","audio":"/audio/849e8b72fa03e3c90dcb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31486","senseId":"1","lemma":"우체국","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어디","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있나요?","meaning":"在，待，住","explanation":"있다：在，待，住；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"9","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"9ff63e71387c2c60","term":"가깝다","zh":"近","audio":"/audio/9ff63e71387c2c60a305.mp3","entryId":"65200","definition":"离某个地方不远。","pronunciation":["가깝따"]},{"id":"849e8b72fa03e3c9","term":"우체국","zh":"邮局","audio":"/audio/849e8b72fa03e3c90dcb.mp3","entryId":"31486","definition":"负责邮寄信件、包裹或管理存款等的公共机关。","pronunciation":["우체국"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3